+        // Conker: stereo rendering. Separation is the background disparity as a
+        // fraction of the screen width (each eye shifts by +/- separation in NDC at
+        // infinity, so the total background disparity is separation * screen width);
+        // convergence is the distance (world units) of the zero-parallax plane. With
